        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Ncobeni njoolobya buzike bwazilao zya-Jakobo, azikalilo zyakwe njoozifwida luzyalo, nkabela munzi uyooyakululwa azitantala zyawo, aŋanda yabwami iyooba mbubonya mbuyakabede. ",
