        {
          "text": "Mwami wabo uyooba umwi wabasimukowanyina, ayooyo uubeendelezya uyoozwa kulimbabo beni. Njoomuswenya kufwaafwi kulindime, nkaambo taakwe uukonzya kuswena kufwaafwi kulindime mwini, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
